  "details": "When joining the world \"Idle Cube\" by CryoZONE I noticed that I can barely see more than ~1 meter then my view seems to be blocked by a sphere after that point. My theory is the author of this world is using some shader that doesn't play well with rendering on the iOS build of VRChat.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Open VRChat iOS Beta\n\n2. Load the world \"Idle Cube\" by CryoZONE\n\n a. World Link: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_bc647b75-363d-40ed-ac02-c576098a1efc\n\nDevice info: iPhone 16 Pro\n\nOS: iOS 18.3.2",
